  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 (config_005/006) outperforms pca_n2000 in multiprofile RNA-only models. This experiment tests scgpt (a novel RNA encoder) in multiprofile settings with avgpool aggregation, isolating the impact of RNA representation. It directly compares a promising encoder (scvi_n200) against a new one (scgpt) in the same profile/aggregation context, reducing uncertainty about encoder effectiveness. This is critical for determining if further RNA encoder improvements are worthwhile before exploring multimodal components."  
